            squares, by construction, and where the remaining horizontal morphisms in the top row are induced by the universal property of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"} homotopy pullback
            and the morphisms downstairs.
          %p The claim is that
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                the top row encodes the
