          %h2#References References
          %h3#general_2 General
          %p An original reference on the notion of a principal bundle as a quotient map by a free continuous action of a topological group is
          %ul
            %li#Cartan
              %em
                Séminaire
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Henri+Cartan"} Henri Cartan
              1949-1950
              %em Topologie algébrique
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/volume/SHC_1948-1949__1"}> numdam:SHC_1948-1949__1
              )
          %p
            some of which is recollected in (
            %a{:href => "#Palais61"}> Palais 61
            ).
          %p
            See also the references at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+space"} classifying space
          %p Textbook accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Steenrod51
              %p
