              )
          %h3#examples_2 Examples
          %p
            Discussion of topological quotients of groups
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                  %mo →
                  %mi G
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi H
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G \to G/H
            as principal
            = succeed "-bundles" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi H
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H
          %ul
            %li#Gleason50
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Gleason"}> Andrew Gleason
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Spaces with a compact Lie group of transformations
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#Palais61"} Palais 61
          %p Explicit examples and counter examples of coset principal bundles are discussed in
          %ul#Karube
            %li
              Takashi Karube,
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the local cross-sections in locally compact groups
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.jmsj/1261148669"} Euclid
          %ul#Mostert
            %li
              Paul Mostert,
              %em Local cross sections in locally compact groups
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.pages.drexel.edu/~gln22/Local%20Cross%20Sections%20in%20Locally%20Compact%20Groups.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p Relations between classes of continuous and of smooth principal bundles are discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              Christoph Müller,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christoph+Wockel"} Christoph Wockel
              = succeed "," do
                %em Equivalences of smooth and continuous principal bundles with infinite-dimensional structure groups
          %h3#ReferencesExtensions Extensions
          %p Extensions of principal bundles are discussed for instance in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kirill+Mackenzie"}> Kirill Mackenzie
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On extensions of principal bundles
            %li
              %p
                I. Androulidakis,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classification of extensions of principal bundles and transitive Lie groupoids with prescribed kernel and cokernel
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://users.uoa.gr/~iandroul/A-gpdextnclass.pdf"} pdf
          %h3#automorphism_groups Automorphism groups
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/automorphism+groups"} automorphism groups
            of principal bundles are discussed for instance in
          %ul
            %li
              M.C. Abbati, R. Cirelli, A. Mania, P. Michor
              %em The Lie group of automorphisms of a principal bundle
              1989 JGP
              %strong 6
              215 (
              %a{:href => "http://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~michor/AutomorphismPrincipleBundle.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0393-0440%2889%2990015-6"} doi
